Thumbs.db

# Developer-machine artifacts that are gitignored but sit in backend/ on a build host.
# `COPY . .` ships whatever is on disk, and v0.6.0 published several of these (mutmut's
# mutated source, a SQLite test DB, celery beat state, the import-linter cache).
# scripts/check-image-hygiene.sh fails an image containing any name on its denylist AT ANY
# DEPTH, so each one is excluded here with `**/` (which also matches at the context root).
# One rule per name: backend/tests/unit/test_image_hygiene.py fails on a redundant rule, so
# deleting the only one that covers a name is caught.
**/mutants
**/mutmut-stats.json
**/.mutmut-cache
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/celerybeat-schedule*
**/.import_linter_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov
**/node_modules
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.claude
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.bak
**/*.orig
**/backups
**/*.log
